  "text": "COMMONWEALTH ADVERTISING DIVISION\nDepartment of the Treasury\nSYDNEY\nJune 10, 1955.\nMr. C. H. McFadyen, C.B.E•,\nSecretary,\nDepartment of Shipping & Transport,\nRialto Buildings,\n497 Collins Street,\nDear Mr. McFadyen,\nPermit me to offer you sincere congratulations from\nthis Division and myself personally upon the high\nhonor which Her Majesty has been pleased to confer\nSuch acknowledgment of your public\nservice is, if I may say so, richly deserved, and\naffords great satisfaction to those of us who,\nthough not closely associated, have been privileged\nto have official relationships with you.\nYours faithfully,\n(W. M. Rutledge)\nDirector.\nULYE\nKEN AND MARIE\nTELOPER PARK\nCANBERRA\nMiCHAEL",
